  (15) In applying Article 24 of the Corporate Tax Act to an asset donated pursuant to Article 8-3 (4) of the Act, its value shall be determined according to Article 36 (1) of the Enforcement Decree of that Act. <Newly Inserted on Feb. 28, 2023>
  (16) A domestic corporation that wishes to be granted a tax credit under Article 8-3 (4) of the Act shall submit an application for the tax credit, in the form prescribed by Ordinance of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, to the head of the tax office having jurisdiction over the place of tax payment, when filing a tax return. <Newly Inserted on Feb. 28, 2023>
