Article 26-4 (Tax Credits for Enterprises Increasing Earned Income) (1) Deleted. <Feb. 17, 2021>
  (2)"Full-time employees prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 29-4 (1) 1 of the Act means workers who have signed an employment contract pursuant to the Labor Standards Act (excluding the following persons; hereafter in this Article, referred to as"full-time employees"): <Amended on Feb. 13, 2018; Feb. 12, 2019; Feb. 11, 2020; Jun. 2, 2020; Feb. 28, 2023>
