  (5) The amount of income tax or corporate tax payable under Article 29-7 (2) of the Act shall be calculated as follows and shall be paid as income tax or corporate tax at the time of filing a tax return for the relevant taxable year: <Amended on Feb. 12, 2019; Feb. 11, 2020>
  1. Where the number of full-time employees or full-time youth employees, etc. decreases from the number of full-time employees in the taxable year in which the tax was first deducted under Article 29-7 (1) of the Act during the period beginning at the end of the taxable year in which the tax was first deducted and ending at the end of the taxable year in which the first anniversary of the end of the taxable year in which the tax was first deducted falls: The amount calculated according to the following subparagraphs (limited to the tax amount deducted under Article 29-7 (1) of the Act in the taxable year within one year immediately preceding the relevant taxable year):
