    (ii) In other cases: An amount calculated by the following formula:
  [Reduced number of full-time youth employees, etc., as compared to the number during the taxable year in which the tax was first deducted (limited to the reduced number of full-time employees) × (Amount under Article 29-7 (1) 1 of the Act)] + [Reduced number of full-time employees other than full-time youth employees, etc., as compared to the number during the taxable year in which the tax was first deducted (limited to the reduced number of full-time employees) × Amount under Article 29-7 (1) 2 of the Act]
