  (7) For the purposes of Article 29-7 (1) and (2) of the Act, the number of full-time employees and the number of full-time youth employees, etc., shall be calculated according to the following formula (a fraction of less than 1/100 shall be deemed nil): <Amended on Feb. 12, 2019>
