Article 60 (Tax Reduction or Exemption for Enterprises Relocating Factories to Outside of Seoul Metropolitan Area) (1) "Real estate business, construction business, consumer service business, non-store retailing business, or shipping brokerage business prescribed by Presidential Decree" in the proviso of the provisions, with the exception of the subparagraphs, of Article 63 (1) means the following businesses: Provided, That any business operated by a relocating public institution under subparagraph 2 of Article 2 of the Special Act on the Construction and Development of Innovation Cities and falling under any of the following subparagraphs shall be excluded herefrom:
  1. Real estate rental business;
  2. Real estate brokerage business;
  3. Real estate trading business under Article 122 (1) of the Enforcement Decree of the Income Tax Act;
  4. Construction business (including the development and supply of residential buildings according to the Korea Standard Industrial Classification (excluding the resale of purchased residential buildings));
  5. Consumer services;
  6. Non-store retail business defined in Article 2 (9) of the Distribution Industry Development Act;
  7. Shipping brokerage business under subparagraph 5 of Article 2 of the Marine Transportation Act.
  (2) The requirement for tax reduction under Article 63 (1) 1 of the Act means to have a record of continuous operations (the period of suspension of operations due to an order to improve or relocate emitting facilities or pollutant emission prevention facilities under the Clean Air Conservation Act, the Water Environment Conservation Act, or the Noise and Vibration Control Act shall be deemed the period of operations) for at least three years (or two years in cases of small and medium enterprises) retroactively from the date of suspension of operations in order to relocate factory facilities located within the over-concentration control region of the Seoul Metropolitan area to outside the Seoul Metropolitan area (in cases of small and medium-sized enterprises, outside the over-concentration control region of the Seoul Metropolitan area; hereafter in this Article, the same shall apply).
  (3) "The national shall completely relocate the factory and facilities to outside of the Seoul Metropolitan area…as prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 63 (1) 1 (b) of the Act means that the national meets any of the following requirements; In such cases, Article 63 (4) of the Act shall be applied only to cases where a factory in the over-concentration control region of the Seoul Metropolitan area is transferred to someone else.
  1. Within two years from the date of commencement of business by relocating the factory to outside the Seoul Metropolitan area, the factory in the over-concentration control region of the Seoul Metropolitan area shall be transferred to some else or all of the factory facilities remaining in the over-concentration control region of the Seoul Metropolitan area shall be demolished or closed so that it is impossible to operate the business with such factory facilities;
  2. The national shall commence the business outside the Seoul Metropolitan area within two years from the date of transfer or closure of the factory in the over-concentration control region of the Seoul Metropolitan area (referring to the date of suspension of operations for relocation of the factory, if the national possesses his/her own factory facilities in a site or building leased for the factory; hereafter in this subparagraph, the same shall apply): Provided, That if the national relocates a factory to a new building built by him/her, he/she shall commence the business within three years from the date of transfer or closure of the factory in the over-concentration control region of the Seoul Metropolitan area.
  (4) "Area prescribed by Presidential Decree, such as the Seoul Metropolitan area" in Article 63 (1) 2 (a) (i) of the Act means any of the following areas: Provided, That the area referred to in subparagraph 2 is applicable only to cases where an enterprise relocating to the area is a small or medium enterprise: <Amended on Feb. 28, 2023>
  1. Jurisdictional area of Dangjin-si, Asan-si, Wonju-si, Eumseong-gun, Jincheon-gun, Cheonan-si, Chuncheon-si, Chungju-si, Hongcheon-gun (excluding Nae-myeon), and Hoengseong-gun;
  2. Growth management regions and nature preservation regions under Article 6 (1) 2 and 3 of the Seoul Metropolitan Area Readjustment Planning Act.
  (5) "Area prescribed by Presidential Decree, such as a Metropolitan City outside of the Seoul Metropolitan City" in Article 63 (1) 2 (a) (ii) of the Act means any of the following areas: <Newly Inserted on Feb. 28, 2023>
  1. Jurisdictional area of a metropolitan city located outside the Seoul Metropolitan area;
  2. Jurisdictional area of Gumi-si, Gimhae-si, Jeonju-si, Jeju-si, Jinju-si, Changwon-si, Cheongju-si, or Pohang-si.
  (6) An amount of tax payable under Article 63 (2) of the Act shall be calculated as follows: <Amended on Feb. 28, 2023>
  1. In cases of Article 63 (2) 1 of the Act: The tax amount reduced or exempted within three years retroactively from the date of closure or dissolution of the corporation;
