Article 60-2 (Tax Reduction or Exemption for Corporations Relocating Head Offices to Outside of Seoul Metropolitan Area) (1) "Real estate business, construction business, consumer service business, non-store retailing business, or shipping brokerage business prescribed by Presidential Decree" in the proviso of the provisions, with the exception of the subparagraphs, of Article 63-2 (1) means the businesses referred to in Article 60 (1).
  (2) The requirement for tax reduction or exemption under Article 63-2 (1) 1 (a) of the Act means to have a record of business operations with its head office in the over-concentration control region of the Seoul Metropolitan area continuously for at least three years retroactively from the date of registration of the relocation of the head office or principal place of business (hereafter in this Article referred to as "the head office").
  (3) "That the corporation shall relocate its head office to outside of the Seoul Metropolitan area, as prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 63-2 (1) 1 (b) of the Act means that any of the following requirements shall be met. In such cases, the application of Article 63-2 (4) of the Act shall be limited to the relocation of the head office in the over-concentration control region of the Seoul Metropolitan area:
  1. To transfer the head office in the over-concentration control region of the Seoul Metropolitan area to someone else or convert it to a use other than a head office (including use as an office below the standard prescribed in paragraph (12); hereafter in this Article, the same shall apply) within two years from the date of commencement of business after relocating its head office to outside of the Seoul Metropolitan area;
  2. To commence business outside the Seoul Metropolitan area within two years of the date of transfer or conversion of the head office in the Seoul Metropolitan area to any use other than head office: Provided, That if the head office is relocated to a new building constructed by the relocating enterprise, its business shall commence within three years from the date of transferring the head office in the over-concentration control region of the Seoul Metropolitan area or converting it to a use other than head office.
  (4) "Criteria prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 63-2 (1) 1 (c) of the Act are as follows: <Newly Inserted on Feb. 15, 2022>
  1. Investment amount: The cumulative amount of investments in business assets as prescribed by Ordinance of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, calculated as prescribed by Ordinance of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, shall be at least one billion;
  2. Personnel in service: The head office relocated to outside of the Seoul Metropolitan area (hereafter in this Article referred to as"relocated head office") shall have at least 20 persons in service in the relevant taxable year.
  (5)"Income prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 63-2 (1) 2 (a) of the Ac, means the amount in item 1 minus the amount in item 2. In such cases, if the difference is negative, it shall be deemed nil. <Amended on Feb. 15, 2022>
  1. The aggregate of gains on disposal of fixed assets, gains on disposal of securities, interest received, dividends received, and gains on receipt of assets as a gift: Provided, That in cases of corporations engaged in any financial or insurance business (excluding financial holding companies under the Financial Holding Companies Act), gains on disposal of securities, interest received, and dividends received that can be recognized as operating income according to the Korea Financial Accounting Standards shall be excluded herefrom;
  2. The aggregate of losses on disposal of fixed assets, losses on disposal of securities, and interest paid. Provided, That in cases of corporations engaged in any financial or insurance business (excluding financial holding companies under the Financial Holding Companies Act), losses on disposal of securities and interest paid that can be recognized as operating expenses according to the Korea Financial Accounting Standards shall be excluded herefrom.
  (6) The number of personnel of the relocating head office and the total number of personnel of the corporation for the relevant taxable year shall be the number of personnel calculated according to the following subparagraphs: <Amended on Feb. 15, 2022>
  1. The number of personnel of the relocating head office: The number of personnel calculated by subtracting the number in item (b) from the number in item (a):
    (a) The annual average number of full-time personnel engaged in business of the head office at the relocated head office (referring to the number of personnel calculated by aggregating the number of personnel as of the end of each month and dividing the aggregate by the number of months; hereafter in this article, the same shall apply); Provided, That, the cases in which the number of personnel engaged in business of the head office in an area outside of the Seoul Metropolitan area is transferred to the relocated head office after the taxable year in which the day two years before the date of relocation falls are excluded herefrom;
    (b) The average annual number of full-time personnel engaged in business of the head office at the relocated head office in the taxable year in which the day three years before the date of relocation falls;
  2. Total number of personnel of the corporation: The average annual number of full-time personnel of the corporation.
  (7) For the purposes of paragraph (6), full-time personnel shall consist of persons working full time among employers under Article 2 (1) 2 of the Labor Standards Act and Korean employees who hold an employment contract concluded pursuant to that Act: Provided, That persons falling under any of the following subparagraphs shall be excluded herefrom. <Amended on Feb. 15, 2022>
  1. An employee whose employment contract term is less than one year (excluding employees whose total employment contract term is not less than one year due to consecutive renewal of an employment contract);
  2. A part-time employee defined in Article 2 (1) 9 of the Labor Standards Act: Provided, That an employee whose contractual work hours per month are at least 60 hours shall be deemed a full-time employee;
  3. Non full-time personnel among executive officers specified in Article 40 (1) of the Enforcement Decree of the Corporate Tax Act;
  4. A person in whose case neither the fact that his/her earned income tax has been withheld nor the fact that any of the following amounts has been paid is verified by a book for tax withholding for earned income under Article 196 of the Enforcement Decree of Income Tax Act:
    (a) An employer contribution or employee endowment defined in Article 3 (1) 11 or 12 of the National Pension Act;
    (b) Premiums of employer-provided policy-holders under Article 69 of the National Health Insurance Act.
  (8) "Consignment processing trade prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 63-2 (1) 2 (c) of the Act means exporting all or part of raw materials to be processed (including manufacturing, assembling, recycling, and renovation; hereafter in this Article, the same shall apply) in a foreign country to a trading partner, or procuring and processing them in a foreign country, and then importing or delivering the processed products to a foreign country. <Amended on Feb. 15, 2022>
  (9) The turnover generated from the consignment processing trade under Article 63-2 (1) 2 (c) of the Act shall be accounted for separately from other turnover. <Amended on Feb. 15, 2022>
  (10) Deleted. <Feb. 28, 2023>
  (11) An amount of tax payable under 63-2 (2) of the Act shall be calculated as follows: <Amended on Feb. 15, 2022>
  1. In cases of Article 63 (2) 1 of the Act: The tax amount reduced or exempted within three years retroactively from the date of closure or dissolution of the corporation;
  2. In cases of Article 63 (2) 2 of the Act: The tax amount reduced or exempted within five years retroactively from the date on which the requirements of paragraph (3) are no longer met;
  3. In cases of Article 63-2 (2) 3 of the Act: An amount of tax reduced or exempted within five years retroactively from the date of establishment of the head office or the date of establishing a place of business of not smaller than the standard prescribed in paragraph (12);
  4. In cases of Article 63-2 (2) 4 of the Act: An amount by which the tax was reduced or exempted retroactively within five years from the date the corporation fails to meet the ratio prescribed in that subparagraph.
  (12) "Where the corporation fails to commence its business after relocating its head office to outside of the Seoul Metropolitan area, as prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 63 (2) 2 of the Act means cases that do not meet any requirement of paragraph (3). <Amended on Feb. 15, 2022>
  (13) "Not smaller than the standard prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 63-2 (2) 3 of the Act means that the ratio of the annual average number of full-time personnel engaged in business of the head office in the place of business in the Seoul Metropolitan area to the annual average number of full-time personnel engaged in business of the head office after the taxable year in which the third anniversary of the date of relocation of the head office to outside of the Seoul Metropolitan area falls is 50/100 or more. <Amended on Feb. 15, 2022>
  (14)"Executive officers prescribed by Presidential Decree" In Article 63-2 (2) 4 of the Act means the persons referred to in Article 40 (1) of the Enforcement Decree of the Corporate Income Tax Act: Provided, That non full-time officers shall be excluded herefrom. <Amended on Feb. 15, 2022>
  (15) No corporation shall be entitled to a reduction or exemption in corporate tax under Article 63-2 (1) of the Act from the taxable year in which it falls under any of the following cases: <Amended on Feb. 15, 2022>
  1. Where it fails to meet the requirement of paragraph (4) 2;
  2. Where it falls under Article 63-2 (2) 4 of the Act.
  (16) Any corporation that wishes to be granted a reduction or exemption of corporate tax under Article 63-2 (1) of the Act shall file an application for tax reduction or exemption and a statement of calculation of tax reduction or exemption, in the forms stipulated by Ordinance of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, with the head of the tax office having jurisdiction over the place of tax payment, along with its tax return. <Amended on Feb. 15, 2022>
  (17) "Classification prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 63-2 (5) of the Act means a class of the Korea Standard Industrial Classification. <Amended on Feb. 15, 2022>
