Article 61 (Tax Reduction or Exemption for Enterprises that Occupy Agro-Industrial Complexes) (1) "Agro-industrial complex prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 64 (1) 1 of the Act means any agro-industrial complex in a Si (including special self-governing cities and administrative cities under Article 10 (2) of the Special Act on the Establishment of Jeju Special Self-Governing Province and the Development of Free International City; hereafter in paragraph (2), the same shall apply), Gun, or Gu (referring to an autonomous Gu; hereafter in paragraph (2), the same shall apply) with a population of less than 200,000 persons as at the date of designation as an agro-industrial complex, which is located in an area outside of the over-concentration control region of the Seoul Metropolitan area. <Amended on Dec. 29, 2000; Dec. 30, 2002; Feb. 18, 2010; Feb. 28, 2023>
