  (4) "Amount computed by the formula prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 61 (3) of the Act means the amount calculated by multiplying the amount of subparagraph 1 minus the amount of subparagraph 2 by the ratio of subparagraph 3: <Newly Inserted on Oct. 30, 1999; Dec. 30, 2002; Feb. 19, 2005; Feb. 4, 2009; Feb. 12, 2019>
