    (iv) A beverage manufacturing business.
  (2) An investment eligible for the reduction of, or exemption from, the corporate tax or income tax under Article 121-9 (1) 2 of the Act shall be either of the following: <Amended on Dec. 30, 2003; Jan. 5, 2005; Feb. 19, 2005; Jun. 26, 2007; Dec. 30, 2010; Jan. 22, 2016; Feb. 5, 2016; Feb. 12, 2019>
