  (5) For the purposes of Article 121-20 (4) and (6) of the Act, Article 11-2 (6) and (7) shall apply mutatis mutandis to the scope of full-time employees and of full-time youth employees and the method for calculating the number of full-time employees and the number of full-time youth employees. <Amended on Feb. 12, 2019; Feb. 15, 2022; Feb. 28, 2023>
  (6) The amount of the corporate tax and income tax to be additionally collected pursuant to Article 121-20 (8) of the Act shall be the full amount of tax reduced or exempted. <Newly Inserted on Dec. 30, 2010; Feb. 15, 2022>
  (7)"Tax amount calculated as prescribed by Presidential Decree" in the former part of the provisions, with the exception of the subparagraphs, of Article 121-20 (10) of the Act means a tax amount in either of the following cases: <Newly Inserted on Feb. 15, 2022>
