Article 116-36 (Reduction or Exemption of Corporate Tax for Enterprises Incorporated in Opportunity Development Special Zone) (1) "Manufacturing industry and other types of business prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 121-33 (1) 1 of the Act means the following types of business:
