Article 116-38 (Special Taxation on Investors in Special Opportunity Development Zone) (1) "Collective investment scheme in kind prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 121-35 (1) 1 of the Act means a collective investment scheme referred to any of the following subparagraphs:
