    (b) Small and medium-sized enterprises or middle-standing enterprises confirmed by the Minister of Trade, Industry and Energy as having relocated or planning to relocate to a special opportunity development zone pursuant to Article 121-34 (1) of the Act;
  5. Stocks issued by a resident enterprise for the purpose of operating a business in a special opportunity development zone and acquired by investing in any of the following methods:
