    (b) Payment for the price of stocks newly issued for capital increase, where the relevant resident increases capital by issuing new stocks after its incorporation.
  (3) "Proportion prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 121-35 (1) 2 of the Act means 60/100.
  (4) The investment ratio prescribed in Article 121-35 (1) 2 of the Act shall be the annual average ratio of the value of the investment objects in total assets of a collective investment scheme for special opportunity development zone, which shall be calculated according to the following formula; In such cases, the period for determining the annual average ratio shall be the period of one year from the date of creation, establishment date, or business license (hereafter this paragraph referred to as "establishment date or the like") of the relevant collective investment scheme for special opportunity development zone. Annual average ratio + A + B A: Aggregate of daily investment ratio Investment ratio = Value of target investment assets/Total assets of the specific infrastructure fund B: Total number of days during each year from the establishment date or the like
  Annual average ratio + A + B
  A: The ratio of sum of daily investment ratios
  * Investment ratio = Value of target investment assets / Total assets of the collective investment schemes of special opportunity development zones
  B: Total number of days for every one year from the date of establishment, etc.
  (5) Where a collective investment scheme for a special opportunity development zone invests in target investment assets through another collective investment scheme, the value of the investment object in the formula of paragraph (4) shall be calculated according to following formula:
  Value of target investment assets = A+B
  A: Value of target investment assets held by the collective investment schemes of special opportunity development zones
  B: Value of equity securities or beneficiary certificates of other collective investment schemes held by the collective investment schemes of special opportunity development zones x (Value of target investment assets held by other collective investment schemes / Total assets of other collective investment schemes)
