  A: Investment principal of target investment assets held by the collective investment schemes of special opportunity development zones
  B: Investment principal of equity securities or beneficiary certificates of other collective investment schemes held by the collective investment schemes of special opportunity development zones x (Value of target investment assets held by other collective investment schemes / Total assets of other collective investment schemes)
  (7) Notwithstanding the formula of paragraph (4), the period falling under any of the following subparagraphs and the daily investment rate for that period shall be excluded from the calculation of the annual average rate:
  1. Three months from the establishment date of the collective investment scheme for special opportunity development zones;
  2. Three months before the date of termination or dissolution of the collective investment scheme for special opportunity development zones;
  3. Other periods prescribed by Ordinance of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, such as the delay period of real estate development projects.
  (8) The specific requirements for a dedicated account under Article 121-35 (2) of the Act (hereafter in this Article referred to as "dedicated account") are as follows:
  1. The name of the account shall be a dedicated account of the collective investment scheme for special opportunity development zones;
