(1) Previous Article 2 and the Enforcement Decree of the Framework Act on Small and Medium Enterprises before an amendment by the Presidential Decree No. 17026 for amendment to the said Enforcement Decree shall apply to the case where a judgment of whether corresponding to the category of small or medium enterprises in the taxable year commenced before this Decree enters into force.
