(1) The amended provisions of Article 14 (1) and (2) shall begin to apply from the first investment made in a venture business investment trust created after this Decree enters into force.
(2) The amended provisions of Article 14 (3) shall begin to apply from the first contribution or investment made after the partially amended Restriction of Special Taxation Act (Act No. 15227) enters into force.
