The amended provisions of Articles 34 and 116-30 shall begin to apply from the first case of filing a tax return after this Decree enters into force.
Article 7 (Applicability to Special Taxation for Assumption or Payment of Debts)
The amended provisions of Article 36 shall begin to begin to apply from the fist case of filing a tax return after this Decree enters into force.
