The amended provisions of Article 43-8 (6) shall begin to apply from the first case of investing in a venture business investment trust created after this Decree enters into force.
Article 9 (Applicability to Grounds for Revoking Designation of Organization Eligible for Donation Incentives)
The amended provisions of Article 71 (7) 3 shall begin to apply from the first ground arising in the business year commencing on or after January 1, 2019.
