The amended provisions of Article 104-5 (5) shall begin to apply from the first application for a tax credit filed on or after January 1, 2019.
Article 11 (Applicability to Organization Performing Governmental Affairs)
The amended provisions of Article 106 (7) 57 shall begin to apply from the first case of filing a report or making a decision or correction after this Decree enters into force.
Article 12 (Applicability to Special Taxation for Assumption or Payment of Debts)
The amended provisions of Article 116-31 shall begin to apply from the first case of filing a tax return after this Decree enters into force.
Article 13 (Applicability to Special Taxation for Exchange of Stocks between Enterprises)
The amended provisions of Article 116-34 (7) shall begin to apply to the first case where a stockholder, etc. falls under any subparagraph of Article 121-30 (3) of the Act after this Decree enters into force.
Article 14 (Applicability to Special Taxation for Cash Receipt Service Operators and Cash Receipt Merchants)
The amended provisions of Article 121-3 (8) shall begin to apply from the first case of issuing a Cash Receipt on or after April 1, 2018.
