(1) In applying the amended provisions of the main sentence of Article 66-3 (3) 1, in cases of land, etc. for fishery incorporated into a residential, commercial, or industrial area under the National Land Planning and Utilization Act as at the time this Decree enters into force, the enforcement date of this Decree shall be deemed the date it is incorporated into the residential, commercial or industrial area under the National Land Planning and Utilization Act.
(2) In applying the amended provisions of Article 66-3 (3) 2, in cases of land, etc. for fishery designated as reserved land for replotting to any land other than land, etc. for fishery before a replotting disposition is issued under the Urban Development Act or any other Act as at the time this Decree enters into force, the enforcement date of this Decree shall be deemed the date such reserve land for replotting is designated.
Article 16 (Special Cases concerning Reduction or Exemption of Capital Gains Tax on Self-Cultivated Mountainous Districts)
(1) In applying the amended provisions of the main sentence of Article 66-4 (3) 1, in cases of a mountainous district incorporated into a residential, commercial or industrial area under the National Land Planning and Utilization Act as at the time this Decree enters into force, the enforcement date of this Decree shall be deemed the date such mountainous district is incorporated into residential, commercial or industrial area under the National Land Planning and Utilization Act.
(2) In applying the amended provisions of Article 66-4 (3) 2, in cases of a mountainous district designated as reserved land for replotting to any land other than a mountainous district before a replotting disposition is issued under the Urban Development Act or any other Act as at the time this Decree enters into force, the enforcement date of this Decree shall be deemed the date such reserve land for replotting is designated.
Article 17 (Transitional Measures concerning Income Deduction for Contributions to Small or Medium Start-Up Investment Funds)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 14 (1) and (2), any venture business investment trust established before this Decree enters into force shall be governed by the former provisions
Article 18 (Transitional Measures concerning Special Taxation for Enterprises Undergoing Trade Adjustment Assistance whose Business is Converted)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 30 (9) 2 (a), cases where no business conversion is conducted under Article 33 (1) of the Act or where a converted business is closed or dissolved before this Decree enters into force shall be governed by the former provisions.
Article 19 (Transitional Measures concerning Special Taxation for Re-Investment in Venture Businesses after Sale of Stocks)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 43-8 (6), cases where an investment is made in a venture business investment trust created before this Decree enters into force shall be governed by the former provisions.
Article 20 (Transitional Measures concerning Leniency of Requirements for Special Taxation for Delinquent Taxes of Resurgent Small or Medium Entrepreneurs)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 99-6, any resurgent small or medium entrepreneur who has filed an application for deferment before this Decree enters into force shall be governed by the former provisions.
Article 21 (Transitional Measures concerning Special Taxation for Exchange of Stocks between Enterprises)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 116-34 (7), cases where a stockholder, etc. falls under any subparagraph of Article 121-30 (3) of the Act shall be governed by the former provisions.
Article 22 (Transitional Measures concerning Special Taxation for Cash Receipt Service Operators and Cash Receipt Merchants)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 121-3 (8), portions for which Cash Receipts are issued on or before March 31, 2018 shall be governed by the former provisions.
Article 23 (Scope of Project Sites to which Reduction or Exemption Ceilings of Capital Gains Tax on Farmland Cultivated by Farmer-Owner or Site for Livestock Stables Applies for Five Years)
"Project site prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 61 of the Addenda to the partially amended Restriction of Special Taxation Act (Act No. 15227), means a project site, at least one half of the entire area of which has been acquired by the implementer of a public works project as at December 31, 2017.

