Article 30 (Transitional Measures concerning Labor Encouragement Subsidies and Child Care Subsidies)
Notwithstanding the amended provisions of Article 100-6 (5) and attached Tables 11 and 11-2, an application for a labor encouragement subsidy or child care subsidy filed before this Decree enters into force shall be governed by the former provisions.

