30609
ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 30609, Apr. 14, 2020>
Article 1 (Enforcement Date)
This Decree shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation.
Article 2 (Applicability to Tax Reduction or Exemption for Overseas Korean Enterprises on Reshoring to Korea)
The amended provisions of Article 104-21 (3) and (11) shall apply to cases where a person establishes a new business or establishes or expands a place of business after this Decree enters into force.
Article 3 (Applicability to Reduction or Exemption of Individual Consumption Tax for Replacing Decrepit Motor Vehicles)
The amended provisions of Article 111 (8) 3 shall apply to motor vehicles shipped out from the manufacturing place or declared for importation on or after January 1, 2020.
